[Music]  there's outrage and anger at the rape  and murder of the two teenage girls in  Uttar Pradesh demonstrators and rights  activists at this protest in Delhi  accused authorities in the state of not  being serious about tackling sexual  violence against women villagers found  the dead girls hanging from a tree  they then kept silent Watch refusing to  let authorities remove the bodies until  the suspects had been detained  doctors say post mortem show that both  girls suffered sexual attacks three men  stand accused of rape and murder two of  them have been arrested we sent a patrol  to arrests the third accused man the  search operation was carried out last  night and we also checked potential  hideouts but we couldn't find him on  email the father of one victim said the  girl's lives could have been saved if  police had acted earlier the case shines  a light on India's outlawed caste system  the girls are from the Dalit or  so-called Untouchables who often still  face widespread discrimination last year  India tightened its rape laws after the  gang rape and murder of a student  triggered international outrage this  latest case is one of the first  challenges for the new government of  Prime Minister Narendra Modi his  interior minister has already called for  an investigation

